    "# Research Objective\n",
    "\n",
    "*Requires data modeling and quantitative research in Transport, Infrastructure & Logistics*"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "What impact will the introduction of the compulsory helmet rule for underage e-bike users have on road safety?\n",
    "    To what extent will the number of accidents involving e-bike users change?\n",
    "    To what extent will the introduction of a compulsory helmet rule affect the road safety of other road users?\n",
    "    To what extent will underage e-bike users comply with this new legislation?\n",
    "        To what extent will this new legislation have a positive/negative impact on the behaviour of underage e-bike users?\n",
    "        To what extent will increased enforcement affect the behaviour of underage e-bike users?\n",
    "    To what extent will the introduction of compulsory helmet use reduce/increase the use of e-bikes?\n",
    "\n",
    "Toename doden op de fiets (vooral hoofdletsel)\n",
    "https://www.cbs.nl/nl-nl/nieuws/2026/15/meer-verkeersdoden-in-2025\n",
    "\n",
    "gebruik van speed pedelecs, afname (helmplicht sinds 2017)\n",
    "https://www.cbs.nl/nl-nl/nieuws/2025/34/groei-aantal-speedpedelecs-zwakt-verder-af\n",
    "\n",
    "afname in snorfietsen na helmplicht in 2023 (ook ombouwen van brom- naar snorfiets nam hierdoor af)\n",
    "https://www.cbs.nl/nl-nl/nieuws/2023/40/daling-aantal-snorfietsen-met-bijna-10-procent\n",
    "\n",
    "De trend van verkeersongevallen met elektrische fietsen waarvan slachtoffers de spoedeisende hulp hebben bezocht (2020-2024)\n",
    "https://www.veiligheid.nl/sites/default/files/2025-08/def_rapport_ongevallen_met_niet-elektrische_fietsen_2024_13_aug_2025.pdf\n"
    "Literatuur; effecten van fietshelm:\n",
    "https://swov.nl/nl/publicatie/feiten-over-de-fietshelm\n",
    "\n"
   ]
  },
